ansparent px-3 text-[14px] font-bold transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 active:bg-gray-100" data-interaction="mobile-top-bar-log-in" href="/i/jf/onboarding/web?mode=login&amp;redirect_after_login=%2FZTZZBTC%2Fstatus%2F2045194707031171489">Log in</a><a class="bg-gray-1100 hover:bg-gray-1100/90 dark:text-gray-1100 flex h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-4 text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition-colors dark:bg-gray-100" href="/i/jf/onboarding/web?mode=signup&amp;redirect_after_login=%2FZTZZBTC%2Fstatus%2F2045194707031171489">Sign up</a></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--$--><h1 class="sr-only">ZTZZ ฿ on X: &quot;看见会所兄爆了，很难过。会所是我少数看的中文区交易员，而且人很真挚。
我说一个前几天群里讨论的交易细节。
在币圈交易，请尽量在构建你的交易系统时，使用提前挂单的方式。
全部内容如图所示。
币圈是我见过的所有市场里，庄家使用疲劳战术最奏效的地方。
我自己在2021年1月22日的下跌里做ETH的滚仓多单，也就是趋势单。当时被疲劳战术活活耗死，耻辱性的失败，疲劳战术的最后，交易者并不是错误判断，而是人完全疲劳后，错失机会，带来的挫败感更加强烈。
于是我整个的2月复盘，都是在针对性的修改交易系统。
事儿教人，一次就会。
希望会所兄能好好休息，稳步把钱赚回来。&quot;</h1><!--$?--><template id="B:0"></template><!--$--><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/ZTZZBTC" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@ZTZZBTC" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_400x400.jpg 400w"/></div></a></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-start min-w-0"><span class="flex max-w-full min-w-0 shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] max-w-full min-w-0