sult:$R[407]={__typename:"NoteTweet",id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxOTQ3MDY5NzI0NjcyMDE=",text:"看见会所兄爆了，很难过。会所是我少数看的中文区交易员，而且人很真挚。\n我说一个前几天群里讨论的交易细节。\n在币圈交易，请尽量在构建你的交易系统时，使用提前挂单的方式。\n全部内容如图所示。\n币圈是我见过的所有市场里，庄家使用疲劳战术最奏效的地方。\n我自己在2021年1月22日的下跌里做ETH的滚仓多单，也就是趋势单。当时被疲劳战术活活耗死，耻辱性的失败，疲劳战术的最后，交易者并不是错误判断，而是人完全疲劳后，错失机会，带来的挫败感更加强烈。\n于是我整个的2月复盘，都是在针对性的修改交易系统。\n事儿教人，一次就会。\n希望会所兄能好好休息，稳步把钱赚回来。"}}}}}}}}}))($R["tsr"]);document.currentScript.remove()</script><div hidden id="S:0"><div class="relative h-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[600px]" id="urt:conversation:2045194707031171489:none:default"><ul><li><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical border-b border-gray-100" data-timeline-entry="" tabindex="-1"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/ZTZZBTC" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@ZTZZBTC" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1491357677292711936/6UEZ2Qpv_reasonably_small.jpg 