city-75" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap" style="opacity:1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-more" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2zm9 2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2zm7 0c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">看见会所兄爆了，很难过。会所是我少数看的中文区交易员，而且人很真挚。
我说一个前几天群里讨论的交易细节。
在币圈交易，请尽量在构建你的交易系统时，使用提前挂单的方式。
全部内容如图所示。
币圈是我见过的所有市场里，庄家使用疲劳战术最奏效的地方。
我自己在2021年1月22日的下跌里做ETH的滚仓多单，也就是趋势单。当时被疲劳战术活活耗死，耻辱性的失败，疲劳战术的最后，交易者并不是错误判断，而是人完全疲劳后，错失机会，带来的挫败感更加强烈。
于是我整个的2月复盘，都是在针对性的修改交易系统。
事儿教人，一次就会。
希望会所兄能好好休息，稳步把钱赚回来。</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative h-0" style="padding-bottom:calc(113.2249% - 4.529px)"><div class="absolute -inset-0.5"><div class="group/carousel relative h-full"><div class="h-full w-full"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex overflow-x-auto gap-1 h-full snap-x snap-mandatory overscroll-x-contain py-0.5 -ms-3.5 -me-3.5 ps-4 pe-4"><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:0.22021484375"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/ZTZZBTC/status/2045194707031171489/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="high" height="4096" width="902" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" decoding="async" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHqAqqacAAoeF2?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHqAqqacAAoeF2?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHqAqqacAAoeF2?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHqAqqacAAoeF2?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/ZTZZBTC/status/2045194707031171489/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:0.6629834254143646"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-